every 10 ticks:
  loop all sheep:
    if loop-entity's name is "Yakob":
      if metadata value "flying" of loop-entity is less than 500:
        add 1 to metadata value "flying" of loop-entity
      else if metadata value "flying" of loop-entity is not set:
        if random number from 1 to 100 is less than 5:
          set metadata value "flying" of loop-entity to 0
          spawn bat at loop-entity
          make loop-entity ride the last spawned entity
          make the last spawned entity invisible
      else:
        if block 1 under loop-entity is not air:
          kill the nearest bat to loop-entity
          clear metadata value "flying" of loop-entity
